{
  "info": {
    "name": "TraveloAPP Partner API v1.05",
    "description": "Partnerski API (v1.05). Tok: Login -> Harbors -> Search trip -> Order (DRAFT) -> Confirm (CONFIRMED) / Cancel (CANCELED).\n\nPostavke (Collection variables):\n- base_url: bazni URL koji si dobio (test/prod). Za lokalni test servisa: http://localhost:6040\n- tid, otp: kredencijali za login\n- k: tajni kljuc za control_code (NIKAD se ne salje u zahtjevu; koristi se samo za potpis)\n\nToken se sprema automatski nakon Login-a. control_code se racuna automatski u pre-request skriptama (SHA512 preko CryptoJS). Nakon 'Search trip' se order_items automatski popuni iz prvog polaska/cijene.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:6040"
    },
    {
      "key": "tid",
      "value": "SABOOK001"
    },
    {
      "key": "otp",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "k",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "travel_from",
      "value": "HR479"
    },
    {
      "key": "travel_to",
      "value": "HR364"
    },
    {
      "key": "travel_date",
      "value": "2026-09-05"
    },
    {
      "key": "order_number",
      "value": "BW-TEST-001"
    },
    {
      "key": "order_items",
      "value": "[]"
    },
    {
      "key": "trip_uuid",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "order_uuid",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "total_amount",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 Login",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "if (r && r.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', r.token); console.log('token spremljen'); }",
              "pm.test('login 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"tid\": \"{{tid}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{otp}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/api_sales_login",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "api_sales_login"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Vraca { token }. Token vrijedi 24h i ide u Authorization: Bearer <token> svakog daljnjeg poziva. Rate limit: 10/min."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "02 Harbors",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/harbors",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "harbors"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Popis luka. U svim daljnjim pozivima luka se identificira s harbor_code."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "03 Search trip",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// control_code = SHA512(k + travel_from + travel_date + travel_to)",
              "const k = pm.variables.get('k');",
              "const body = {",
              "  travel_from: pm.variables.get('travel_from'),",
              "  travel_to: pm.variables.get('travel_to'),",
              "  travel_date: pm.variables.get('travel_date')",
              "};",
              "const raw = k + body.travel_from + body.travel_date + body.travel_to;",
              "body.control_code = CryptoJS.SHA512(raw).toString();",
              "pm.variables.set('reqBody', JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Za praktičnost: iz prvog polaska/prve cijene složi order_items za sljedeći korak.",
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "if (r && Array.isArray(r.trips) && r.trips.length) {",
              "  const t = r.trips[0];",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('trip_uuid', t.trip_uuid);",
              "  if (Array.isArray(t.prices) && t.prices.length) {",
              "    const p = t.prices[0];",
              "    const item = { trip_uuid: t.trip_uuid, ticket_type_uuid: p.ticket_type_uuid, ticket_type_name: p.ticket_type_name, quantity: 1, single_item_price: p.price, total_item_price: p.price };",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('order_items', JSON.stringify([item]));",
              "    console.log('order_items popunjen iz prvog polaska/cijene');",
              "  }",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{{reqBody}}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/search_trip",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "search_trip"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Pretraga polazaka. Cijena je TVOJA nabavna cijena. Prazni trips = nema polaska tog dana (nije greska). control_code se racuna automatski (pre-request)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "04 Order (DRAFT)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// control_code = SHA512(k + order_number + broj_stavki + suma total_item_price)",
              "const k = pm.variables.get('k');",
              "const order_number = pm.variables.get('order_number');",
              "let items = [];",
              "try { items = JSON.parse(pm.variables.get('order_items') || '[]'); } catch (e) {}",
              "const sum = items.reduce((s, i) => s + Number(i.total_item_price || 0), 0);",
              "const raw = k + order_number + items.length + sum;",
              "const body = { order_number, order_items: items, control_code: CryptoJS.SHA512(raw).toString() };",
              "pm.variables.set('reqBody', JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "if (r && r.order_uuid) pm.collectionVariables.set('order_uuid', r.order_uuid);",
              "if (r && r.order_number) pm.collectionVariables.set('order_number', r.order_number);",
              "// total_amount za confirm/cancel control_code (= suma stavki narudzbe).",
              "let items = [];",
              "try { items = JSON.parse(pm.variables.get('order_items') || '[]'); } catch (e) {}",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('total_amount', items.reduce((s, i) => s + Number(i.total_item_price || 0), 0));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{{reqBody}}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/order",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "order"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Kreira DRAFT (rezervira mjesta, karte jos ne postoje). Vraca order_uuid (nas) — spremi ga. 409 = nema dovoljno mjesta. order_uuid/order_number/total_amount se spremaju automatski (test)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "05 Confirm order (CONFIRMED)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// control_code = SHA512(k + order_uuid + order_number + total_amount)",
              "// order_number i total_amount idu iz odgovora na /order (ne saljemo ih u tijelu).",
              "const k = pm.variables.get('k');",
              "const order_uuid = pm.variables.get('order_uuid');",
              "const order_number = pm.variables.get('order_number');",
              "const total_amount = pm.variables.get('total_amount');",
              "const raw = k + order_uuid + order_number + total_amount;",
              "const body = { order_uuid, control_code: CryptoJS.SHA512(raw).toString() };",
              "pm.variables.set('reqBody', JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{{reqBody}}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/confirm_order",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "confirm_order"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Izdaje karte (tek sad postoje i naplacuju se). Vraca tickets s ticket_code (to putnik pokazuje pri ukrcaju). Potvrdi tek nakon uspjesne naplate."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "06 Cancel order (CANCELED)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// control_code = SHA512(k + order_uuid + order_number + total_amount) — isto kao confirm.",
              "const k = pm.variables.get('k');",
              "const order_uuid = pm.variables.get('order_uuid');",
              "const order_number = pm.variables.get('order_number');",
              "const total_amount = pm.variables.get('total_amount');",
              "const raw = k + order_uuid + order_number + total_amount;",
              "const body = { order_uuid, control_code: CryptoJS.SHA512(raw).toString() };",
              "pm.variables.set('reqBody', JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{{reqBody}}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/cancel_order",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "cancel_order"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Bez dodatnih polja stornira cijelu narudzbu. Za djelomicno: dodaj 'tickets' s ticket_uuid. return_amount = iznos koji ti se odobrava. Vec stornirana karta se ne stornira dvaput."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "07 Trip details",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"trip_uuid\": \"{{trip_uuid}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/trip_details",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "trip_details"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Sve luke na tom polasku, u redoslijedu plovidbe (medupostaje i vremena). Bez control_code-a."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "08 Documentation",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/documentation",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "documentation"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Javna dokumentacija API-ja (bez auth-a)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "99 Negativni testovi (autentikacija i autorizacija)",
      "description": "Provjera da API odbija ono sto mora odbiti. Sretan put pokazuje da integracija radi; ovo pokazuje da nije otvorena. Pokrenuti nakon 01-06, jer koristi token i narudzbu iz njih.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "99.1 Bez tokena → 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('bez tokena je 401', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/harbors",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "harbors"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "99.2 Neispravan token → 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('neispravan token je 401', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/harbors",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "harbors"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "nevaljan.token.ovdje",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "99.3 Krivi control_code → 400",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Namjerno pogresan potpis: ispravna polja, ali potpisana praznim kljucem.",
                  "const body = {",
                  "  travel_from: pm.variables.get('travel_from'),",
                  "  travel_to: pm.variables.get('travel_to'),",
                  "  travel_date: pm.variables.get('travel_date'),",
                  "  control_code: CryptoJS.SHA512('nije-nas-kljuc').toString()",
                  "};",
                  "pm.variables.set('reqBodyKrivi', JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('krivi potpis je 400', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(400));",
                  "pm.test('poruka kaze sto je krivo', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().msg).to.include('control_code'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{reqBodyKrivi}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/search_trip",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "search_trip"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "99.4 Bez control_code → 400",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('bez potpisa je 400', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"travel_from\": \"{{travel_from}}\",\n  \"travel_to\": \"{{travel_to}}\",\n  \"travel_date\": \"{{travel_date}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/search_trip",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "search_trip"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "99.5 Tuda/nepostojeca narudzba → 404",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Narudzba koja nije partnerova (ovdje izmisljeni uuid). Servis namjerno",
                  "// vraca isti 404 i za tudu i za nepostojecu — da se popis narudzbi ne da",
                  "// mapirati probavanjem.",
                  "const body = { order_uuid: '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000', control_code: 'nebitno' };",
                  "pm.variables.set('reqBodyTuda', JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('tuda narudzba je 404', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(404));",
                  "pm.test('ne otkriva postoji li', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().msg).to.eql('Order not found'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{reqBodyTuda}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/confirm_order",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "confirm_order"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "99.6 Prijava s krivim OTP-om → 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('krivi OTP ne daje token', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400, 401]);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('token');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tid\": \"{{tid}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"posve-krivi-otp\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/api_sales_login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "api_sales_login"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
